# Normalize every text file to LF, both in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# LF in the working tree is deliberate rather than the usual "native" default.
# C# raw string literals inherit the line endings of their source file, and the
# HLS playlist writers in TVRoom/HLS/HlsStreamState.cs use them - so a CRLF
# checkout changes the bytes served to players. Forcing LF everywhere keeps a
# Windows dev build and the Linux Docker build byte-identical.
#
# This also overrides core.autocrlf, which is inconsistent on at least one dev
# machine (system=true, global=false) and previously produced whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these, regardless of content sniffing.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.db   binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
